sequenceDiagram
    participant U as keyboard (libinput)
    participant C as lumen-compositor (keybindings, router)
    participant A as focused application
    participant S as lumen-shell (switcher)
    Note over C,S: design-session-and-wm K.1–K.2, ADR 010 K2
    U->>C: Alt press
    C->>A: wl_keyboard.key(Alt) + modifiers (forwarded)
    U->>C: Tab press (Alt held)
    C->>C: binding Alt+Tab = switcher.next (held): begin_hold(primary = Alt)
    C->>S: zlm_shell_v1.held_action(new zlm_held_action_v1, "switcher.next", serial)
    S->>S: begin over the task model's MRU order; selection 1; arm the 150 ms open delay
    U->>C: Tab release (its press was never forwarded: dropped)
    alt Alt released within 150 ms (quick switch)
        U->>C: Alt release
        C->>S: released(serial) and the hold ends
        C->>A: wl_keyboard.key(Alt released)
        S->>C: zlm_policy_bridge_v1.request_activate(selection) — nothing was drawn
    else held: the view appears
        S->>C: overlay layer surface "lumen-switcher" (no keyboard, centred)
        U->>C: Tab / Shift+Tab / arrows (presses)
        C->>S: key(keysym, modifiers, binding) — never to the application
        S->>S: step, repaint the two cells that changed
        alt Alt released
            U->>C: Alt release
            C->>S: released(serial)
            S->>C: request_activate(selection), destroy the view
        else Escape (or Return, a click)
            C->>S: key(Escape)
            S->>C: zlm_held_action_v1.destroy — keys go to the application again
            S->>S: close the view, activate nothing (Return / click: activate)
        else lock, VT switch, a move or resize begins
            C->>S: cancelled
            S->>S: close the view, activate nothing
        end
    end
    Note over A: keyboard focus never moved during the hold (no leave/enter)
